exports[`公開画面のスタイル生成 > 一覧カードの順位・ホバー・モバイル表示 がテーマ参照を解決して生成されること 1`] = `".gridItem{aspect-ratio:460/215;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.gridItem:before{content:"";opacity:0;z-index:3;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(225deg,#ffffff26 0%,#0000 55%);transition:opacity .2s;position:absolute;inset:0}@media (hover:hover){.gridItem:hover{text-decoration:none;transform:scale(1.04);box-shadow:0 6px 20px #00000080}.gridItem:hover:before{opacity:1}}.rank1{grid-area:span 2/span 2/span 2/span 2;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #f1c039,0 4px 16px #f1c03959}.rank2{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #b0b8c1,0 4px 12px #b0b8c140}.rank3{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #cd7f32,0 4px 12px #cd7f3240}@media not all and (min-width:640px){.rank1,.rank2,.rank3,.rank4,.rank5{aspect-ratio:460/215;grid-area:auto/1/auto/-1}}.footer{z-index:2;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(#0000,#000c);align-items:baseline;gap:.4rem;padding:.3rem .5rem;display:flex;position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0}.rank{color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 3px #000c;background:#0000008c;border-radius:.25rem;align-items:center;gap:.2rem;padding:.05rem .3rem;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;display:inline-flex}.rank1 .rank{color:#f1c039;font-size:1.3rem}.rank2 .rank{color:#c0c8d0}.rank3 .rank{color:#cd7f32}.rankIcon{flex-shrink:0;display:block}.info{color:#ffffffe6;text-shadow:0 1px 3px #000c;background:#0000008c;border-radius:.25rem;padding:.05rem .3rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1}"`;

exports[`公開画面のスタイル生成 > 記事詳細の項目間の余白と区切り線 がテーマ参照を解決して生成されること 1`] = `".detailItem:not(:last-child){margin-right:calc(var(--spacing,.25rem) * 6);border-right-style:var(--tw-border-style);padding-right:calc(var(--spacing,.25rem) * 6);border-right-width:1px}@property --tw-border-style{syntax:"*";inherits:false;initial-value:solid}"`;
